Plan: convert the data disk data-02 in 'bulk' (xfs)
  1. stop putting new files on it
  2. move its 1.0GB onto the other data disks (3.0GB free)
  3. erase it and format it again as data-02 (xfs)
  4. the parity follows with the next scheduled sync
Moving the files can take hours. The moved files exist once until that sync, like every new file.
ALL DATA on the disk is erased after it was moved.

Dry run: nothing changed.
